Emerging Healthcare Trends Shaping the Market
The industry is rapidly evolving as digital health ecosystems mature. Several trends are reshaping how vital signs data is captured, integrated, and acted upon across care environments:
•	Increasing demand for remote and contactless monitoring
•	Expansion of telemedicine and AI-driven analysis
•	Rising adoption of wearable devices for continuous tracking
•	Shift toward home-based care models
•	Integration of medical devices with electronic health records (EHRs)

